#
# MSBuild reads this file on every dotnet build/test/pack in the repo.
# -mt: build projects on threads in one MSBuild process instead of separate worker processes.
# .NET 11 ships it but does not turn it on by default, so it is opted into here (#2135).
# Its thread count follows -maxcpucount, so CI build steps that pass -maxcpucount:1 stay single-threaded.
-mt
